                                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">local_shipping</span>
                                                <span>@(isEn ? "Request Sample Box to Site" : "اطلب صندوق عينة للموقع الآن")</span>
                                            </button>
                                            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 flex items-center gap-1">
                                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xs text-emerald-600">verified</span>
                                                <span>@(isEn ? "Delivered in 24-48 hrs" : "تصلك خلال 24-48 ساعة")</span>
                                            </span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <!-- 2. Encrypted Showroom Pass (تذكرة معاينة المعرض المشفرة) -->
                                <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white border border-slate-800 shadow-sm relative">
                                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2">
                                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">qr_code_2</span>
                                            </span>
                                            <h5 class="text-xs font-bold text-white">@(isEn ? "Encrypted Showroom Pass" : "تذكرة معاينة معرض مشفرة (Showroom QR Pass)")</h5>
                                        </div>
                                        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-indigo-300 bg-indigo-950/80 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-indigo-800">
                                            @(isEn ? "Free & Guaranteed" : "مجانية ومحمية")
                                        </span>
                                    </div>
                                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-3">
                                        @(isEn ? "Prefer visiting the quarry or supplier showroom? Book a verified digital QR pass to lock in BLOCKO bulk pricing, guarantee milestone escrow protection, and prevent unverified cash deposits." : "ترغب بزيارة ساحة أو معرض الحجر بنفسك؟ احجز تذكرة معاينة رقمية بـ QR Code تضمن لك أسعار بلكو التفضيلية وحماية أموالك بحساب الضمان (Escrow) دون أي تعامل كاش غير مكفول.")
                                    </p>
                                    <button type="button" onclick="openShowroomPassModal()" 
                                            class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white text-xs font-bold transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer">
                                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">confirmation_number</span>
                                        <span>@(isEn ? "Generate Free Showroom Pass" : "إصدار تذكرة معاينة مجانية")</span>
                                    </button>
                                </div>

                                <!-- 3. Escrow Quality Guarantee Badge (حساب الضمان وحماية المشتري) -->
                                <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200/80 text-[11px] text-emerald-950 space-y-1.5">
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-emerald-900">
                                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-600 text-base">security</span>
                                        <span>@(isEn ? "BLOCKO Escrow & Quality Assurance Guarantee:" : "حماية المشتري وحساب الضمان البنكي (BLOCKO Escrow):")</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <ul class="space-y-1 text-emerald-900/90 pr-4 list-disc">
                                        <li>@(isEn ? "Funds are securely held in escrow; zero payment released to the quarry until on-site delivery and physical inspection." : "أموالك بأمان 100%: لا يتم تسليم أي دفعة للمورد إلا بعد وصول الحجر لموقعك ومطابقته للعينة المعتمدة.")</li>
                                        <li>@(isEn ? "Complimentary milestone inspection by BLOCKO structural engineers for residential villas." : "فحص هندسي مجاني للدفعة الأولى بواسطة مهندسي بلكو المعتمدين.")</li>
                                        <li>@(isEn ? "Official digital contract & full replacement warranty against chipping, cracking, or color deviation." : "عقد توريد رسمي وفاتورة ضريبية مع كفالة استبدال فورية لأي حجر مخالف للمواصفات.")</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- ════════════ TAB 3: 3D ARCHITECTURAL HOUSE VIEWER ════════════ -->
                    <div id="tabContentVisualizer" class="space-y-4 hidden">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-600 text-base">view_in_ar</span>
                                    <span>@(isEn ? "Interactive 3D Architectural Configurator" : "مجسم معماري ثلاثي الأبعاد تفاعلي (3D)")</span>
                                </h4>
                                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">@(isEn ? "Realistic Jordanian stone courses, textures, and details" : "يحاكي مداميك الحجر الأردني والكحلة والديكورات بدقة")</p>
                            </div>
                            <button type="button" onclick="toggleXRayMode()" id="xrayBtn"
                                    class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-700 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 shadow-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-all">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-indigo-600">visibility</span>
                                <span id="xrayBtnText">@(isEn ? "X-Ray Skeleton" : "رؤية الهيكل العظم")</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Architectural Typology Selector -->
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
                                <label class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800">@(isEn ? "Architectural Design Typology" : "النمط والتصميم المعماري للمبنى")</label>
                                <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-emerald-200" id="currentStyleLabel">@(isEn ? "Classic Villa" : "فيلا كلاسيكية")</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
                                <button type="button" onclick="setArchitecturalStyle('apartment')" id="arch-btn-apartment"
                                        class="arch-style-btn p-2 rounded-xl border text-[11px] font-semibold bg-white text-slate-700 border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all flex flex-col items-center gap-1 text-center">
                                    <span class="text-lg">🏢</span>
                                    <span class="font-bold">@(isEn ? "Apartments" : "عمارة سكنية")</span>
                                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-normal">@(isEn ? "Multi-floor & Balconies" : "طوابق وبرندات")</span>
                                </button>
                                <button type="button" onclick="setArchitecturalStyle('classic')" id="arch-btn-classic"
                                        class="arch-style-btn p-2 rounded-xl border text-[11px] font-bold bg-slate-900 text-white border-slate-900 shadow-sm transition-all flex flex-col items-center gap-1 text-center">
                                    <span class="text-lg">🏡</span>
                                    <span class="font-bold">@(isEn ? "Classic Villa" : "فيلا كلاسيك")</span>
                                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-300 font-normal">@(isEn ? "Arches & Portico" : "أقواس وأعمدة")</span>
                                </button>
                                <button type="button" onclick="setArchitecturalStyle('modern')" id="arch-btn-modern"
                                        class="arch-style-btn p-2 rounded-xl border text-[11px] font-semibold bg-white text-slate-700 border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all flex flex-col items-center gap-1 text-center">
                                    <span class="text-lg">🏛️</span>
                                    <span class="font-bold">@(isEn ? "Modern Villa" : "فيلا مودرن")</span>
                                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-normal">@(isEn ? "Cantilevers & Glass" : "بروزات وزجاج")</span>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                            <input type="hidden" id="architecturalStyle" value="classic" />
                        </div>

                        <!-- Active Building Info Bar (Above Canvas - No obstruction) -->
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white text-xs border border-slate-700 shadow-sm">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 inline-block animate-pulse"></span>
                                <span id="canvasOverlayInfo" class="font-bold text-[12px] text-slate-100">Classic Villa • 2 Floors • Ruwaished Stone</span>
                            </div>
                            <button type="button" onclick="reset3DCamera()" class="px-2 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 text-[11px] font-bold border border-slate-600 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1" title="@(isEn ? "Reset View" : "إعادة ضبط الكاميرا")">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">restart_alt</span>
                                <span>@(isEn ? "Reset View" : "واجهة أمامية")</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 3D Canvas Viewport Container (Clean - Completely unobstructed) -->
                        <div class="relative w-full h-[460px] rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700/80 overflow-hidden shadow-inner block">
                            <canvas id="threeCanvas" class="w-full h-full cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing block"></canvas>
                        </div>

                        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-[11px] text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-1">
                            <p>💡 <strong>@(isEn ? "Interactive Controls:" : "التحكم التفاعلي:")</strong> @(isEn ? "Drag to rotate 360°. Scroll to zoom in/out. Right-click drag to pan." : "اسحب بالفأرة أو اللمس للتدوير 360°، واستخدم عجلة الماوس للتكبير والتصغير.")</p>
                            <p>✨ @(isEn ? "Notice the real stone courses (25cm), mortar joints, window arches, cornices, and portico columns reacting live." : "شاهد مداميك الحجر الأردني الواقعية (25 سم)، الكحلة، أقواس الشبابيك، الكرانيش، وأعمدة المدخل تتفاعل فورياً مع خياراتك.")</p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- ════════════ TAB 4: FINISHING & INSULATION ADDONS ════════════ -->
                    <div id="tabContentFinishes" class="space-y-5 hidden">
                        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-teal-50/80 border border-teal-200/80 text-xs text-teal-900 flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-teal-600 text-lg flex-shrink-0">tune</span>
                            <div>
                                <strong class="block font-bold">@(isEn ? "Optional Finishing & MEP Packages" : "إضافات وحزم التشطيبات والعوازل (اختياري)")</strong>
                                <p class="text-[11px] text-teal-700/90 mt-0.5">@(isEn ? "Tailor your project by adding real-world contractor rates per m² for insulation, internal plastering, deluxe painting, and electro-mechanical MEP." : "قم بتخصيص مشروعك بإضافة أسعار المقاولة للمتر المربع تشمل العزل المائي والحراري، القصارة، الدهان، والتأسيسات الكهروميكانيكية.")</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 1. Waterproofing & Thermal Insulation -->
                        @if (calcConfig.EnableInsulationAddon)
                        {
                            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-teal-300 transition-all">
                                <label class="flex items-start justify-between cursor-pointer gap-3">
                                    <div class="space-y-1">
                                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                            <input type="checkbox" id="addonInsulation" onchange="onInputChange()"
                                                   class="w-4 h-4 rounded text-teal-600 focus:ring-teal-500 border-slate-300">
                                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">@(isEn ? "Waterproofing & Thermal Insulation" : "عزل مائي وحراري (أسطح وقواعد)")</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 pe-2">
                                            @(isEn ? $"Bituminous membrane waterproofing for foundations and roof insulation with extruded polystyrene ({calcConfig.InsulationRatePerM2} JOD/m²)" : $"عزل رولات زفتية للقواعد والأسطح + فوم عازل حراري بسعر {calcConfig.InsulationRatePerM2} د.أ/م²")
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-teal-700 bg-teal-50 px-2 py-1 rounded-md border border-teal-200 flex-shrink-0">
                                        @calcConfig.InsulationRatePerM2 @(isEn ? "JOD/m²" : "د.أ/م²")
                                    </span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        }

                        <!-- 2. Internal Plastering (Qasara) -->
                        @if (calcConfig.EnablePlasteringAddon)
                        {
                            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-teal-300 transition-all">
                                <label class="flex items-start justify-between cursor-pointer gap-3">
                                    <div class="space-y-1">
                                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                            <input type="checkbox" id="addonPlastering" onchange="onInputChange()"
                                                   class="w-4 h-4 rounded text-teal-600 focus:ring-teal-500 border-slate-300">
                                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">@(isEn ? "Internal Plastering & Rendering" : "أعمال القصارة الداخلية (بؤج وأوتار)")</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 pe-2">
                                            @(isEn ? $"Internal wall & ceiling 3-coat plastering according to building specs ({calcConfig.PlasteringRatePerM2} JOD/m²)" : $"قصارة داخلية 3 أوجه عالية الاستواء وفق كودات البناء بسعر {calcConfig.PlasteringRatePerM2} د.أ/م²")
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-teal-700 bg-teal-50 px-2 py-1 rounded-md border border-teal-200 flex-shrink-0">
                                        @calcConfig.PlasteringRatePerM2 @(isEn ? "JOD/m²" : "د.أ/م²")
                                    </span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        }

                        <!-- 3. Deluxe Interior Painting -->
                        @if (calcConfig.EnablePaintingAddon)
                        {
                            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-teal-300 transition-all">
                                <label class="flex items-start justify-between cursor-pointer gap-3">
                                    <div class="space-y-1">
                                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                            <input type="checkbox" id="addonPainting" onchange="onInputChange()"
                                                   class="w-4 h-4 rounded text-teal-600 focus:ring-teal-500 border-slate-300">
                                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">@(isEn ? "Deluxe Interior Paint" : "دهانات داخلية ديلوكس (معجونة + وجهين)")</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 pe-2">
                                            @(isEn ? $"Two coats putty + primer + latex super washable finish ({calcConfig.InteriorPaintRatePerM2} JOD/m²)" : $"معجونة وجهين + سيلر مائي + دهان سوبر ديلوكس قابل للغسيل بسعر {calcConfig.InteriorPaintRatePerM2} د.أ/م²")
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-teal-700 bg-teal-50 px-2 py-1 rounded-md border border-teal-200 flex-shrink-0">
                                        @calcConfig.InteriorPaintRatePerM2 @(isEn ? "JOD/m²" : "د.أ/م²")
                                    </span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        }

                        <!-- 4. Electro-Mechanical (MEP) -->
                        @if (calcConfig.EnableElectroMechanicalAddon)
                        {
                            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-teal-300 transition-all">
                                <label class="flex items-start justify-between cursor-pointer gap-3">
                                    <div class="space-y-1">
                                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                            <input type="checkbox" id="addonMEP" onchange="onInputChange()"
                                                   class="w-4 h-4 rounded text-teal-600 focus:ring-teal-500 border-slate-300">
                                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">@(isEn ? "Electro-Mechanical Infrastructure (MEP)" : "تأسيسات كهروميكانيكية (كهرباء وسباكة)")</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 pe-2">
                                            @(isEn ? $"Electrical piping, conduits, sanitary drain pipes, and water supply rough-ins ({calcConfig.ElectroMechanicalRatePerM2} JOD/m²)" : $"تمديدات صحية وتغذية مياه + بايبات وخراطيم ولوحات كهربائية بسعر {calcConfig.ElectroMechanicalRatePerM2} د.أ/م²")
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-teal-700 bg-teal-50 px-2 py-1 rounded-md border border-teal-200 flex-shrink-0">
                                        @calcConfig.ElectroMechanicalRatePerM2 @(isEn ? "JOD/m²" : "د.أ/م²")
                                    </span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        }
                    </div>

                </form>
            </div>

            <!-- Engineering Standards Reference Box -->
            <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-700 space-y-2.5">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-700 text-base">verified</span>
                    <span>@(isEn ? "Approved Jordanian Engineering Standards:" : "المعايير الهندسية الأردنية المعتمدة:")</span>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                    <p>• <strong>@(isEn ? "Steel Rebar:" : "حديد التسليح:")</strong> @(isEn ? "High-strength Grade 60 (JS 29) with flexible column detailing (6, 8, or 10 bars)." : "حديد Grade 60 عالي المقاومة بتفاصيل الأعمدة المرنة (6، 8، أو 10 قضبان).")</p>
                    <p>• <strong>@(isEn ? "Stone Cladding:" : "حجر البناء:")</strong> @(isEn ? "Jordanian natural stone (Ruwaished / Ma'an) or engineered stone, with 7% cutting waste." : "حجر طبيعي نخب أول أو صناعي معتمد، مع حساب نسبة هالك القص 7% وباطون الحشوة.")</p>
                    <p>• <strong>@(isEn ? "Concrete & Cement:" : "الخرسانة والإسمنت:")</strong> @(isEn ? "B250/B300 ready-mix concrete with pump & Portland CEM I 42.5N." : "خرسانة جاهزة B250/B300 مع مضخة، وإسمنت بورتلاندي 42.5N معتمد.")</p>
                    <p>• <strong>@(isEn ? "Pricing:" : "الأسعار:")</strong> @(isEn ? "Delivered to site in designated governorate, including 16% sales tax." : "واصلة الموقع في المحافظة المحددة وشاملة ضريبة المبيعات 16%.")</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ────────────── RIGHT COLUMN: ESTIMATE RESULTS & BOQ ────────────── -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">

            <!-- 1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY TOTAL COST CARD -->
            <div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 text-white shadow-lg border border-slate-800">
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-5">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">
                                @(isEn ? "Estimated Combined Construction & Facades Cost" : "التكلفة الإجمالية التقديرية (عظم + واجهات وديكورات)")
                            </span>
                            <span id="savingsBadge" class="@(Model.PotentialSavingsJod > 0 ? "inline-flex" : "hidden") items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xs">savings</span>
                                <span id="savingsBadgeText">@(isEn ? $"Saved {Model.PotentialSavingsJod:N0} JOD" : $"وفرت {Model.PotentialSavingsJod:N0} د.أ")</span>
                            </span>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
                            <span class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white font-mono" id="grandTotalCost">
                                @Model.GrandTotalCostJod.ToString("N0")
                            </span>
                            <span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400">
                                @(isEn ? "JOD" : "دينار أردني")
                            </span>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Sub-totals: Skeleton vs Stone -->
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-800 text-xs">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-400"></span>
                                <span class="text-slate-400">@(isEn ? "Skeleton Cost:" : "تكلفة العظم:")</span>
                                <strong class="text-white font-mono" id="totalSkeletonCost">@Model.TotalSkeletonCostJod.ToString("N0") @(isEn ? "JOD" : "د.أ")</strong>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-slate-700">•</span>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5" id="stoneSummaryCostGroup">
                                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
                                <span class="text-slate-400">@(isEn ? "Stone & Decor:" : "الحجر والديكورات:")</span>
                                <strong class="text-amber-300 font-mono" id="totalStoneCost">@Model.TotalStoneCostJod.ToString("N0") @(isEn ? "JOD" : "د.أ")</strong>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-slate-700">•</span>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <span class="text-slate-400">@(isEn ? "Avg m²:" : "متوسط المتر:")</span>
                                <strong class="text-emerald-400 font-mono" id="summaryCostPerM2">@Model.CostPerSquareMeterJod @(isEn ? "JOD/m²" : "د.أ/م²")</strong>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Action Buttons -->
                    <div class="action-buttons-group flex flex-col sm:flex-row lg:flex-col gap-2 flex-shrink-0">
                        <button type="button" onclick="sendToQuote()" 
                                class="px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-bold text-xs transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm cursor-pointer">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">request_quote</span>
                            <span>@(isEn ? "Request Official Quote & Supply" : "طلب تسعيرة وتوريد رسمي")</span>
                        </button>

                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <button type="button" onclick="shareWhatsApp()" 
                                    class="flex-1 py-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 text-xs font-semibold border border-slate-700 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-emerald-400">share</span>
                                <span>@(isEn ? "Share" : "مشاركة")</span>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" onclick="triggerPrintReport()" 
                                    class="flex-1 py-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 text-xs font-semibold border border-slate-700 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-slate-300">print</span>
                                <span>@(isEn ? "Print PDF" : "طباعة تقرير PDF")</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Visual Budget Distribution Progress Bar -->
                <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800">
                    <div class="flex justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-400 mb-1.5">
                        <span class="font-medium">@(isEn ? "Relative Budget Breakdown (Materials, Labor & Stone):" : "التوزيع النسبي لتكاليف المواد، المصنعية، والواجهات:")</span>
                        <span id="budgetSummaryText" class="font-mono text-slate-300">
                            @(isEn ? "Steel 22% • Concrete 17% • Stone 25% • Labor & Blocks 36%" : "حديد 22% • خرسانة 17% • حجر 25% • عمالة وطوب 36%")
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-full h-2.5 bg-slate-800 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex gap-0.5 p-0.5 border border-slate-700/60">
                        <div id="barSteel" class="bg-indigo-500 rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 20%" title="@(isEn ? "Steel Rebar" : "حديد التسليح")"></div>
                        <div id="barConcrete" class="bg-blue-500 rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 16%" title="@(isEn ? "Ready-Mix Concrete" : "خرسانة جاهزة")"></div>
                        <div id="barStone" class="bg-amber-500 rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 25%" title="@(isEn ? "Stone Facades & Decor" : "الحجر والواجهات")"></div>
                        <div id="barLabor" class="bg-purple-500 rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 25%" title="@(isEn ? "Labor & Workmanship" : "أجور المقاولة والعمالة")"></div>
                        <div id="barBlocks" class="bg-rose-500 rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 7%" title="@(isEn ? "Masonry Blocks" : "طوب")"></div>
                        <div id="barCement" class="bg-amber-600 rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 4%" title="@(isEn ? "Cement" : "إسمنت")"></div>
                        <div id="barSand" class="bg-teal-500 rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 3%" title="@(isEn ? "Sand & Aggregate" : "رمل وحصمة")"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Escrow Trust Ribbon -->
                <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400 font-semibold">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">verified_user</span>
                        <span>@(isEn ? "BLOCKO Escrow Protection: Payments locked securely until stone inspection on site." : "حماية بلكو وحساب الضمان: لا تُسلّم الدفعات للمورد إلا بعد استلام الحجر ومطابقته للعينة المعتمدة.")</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <button type="button" onclick="openSampleBoxModal()" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/40 hover:bg-amber-500/30 text-[11px] font-bold transition-all flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">inventory_2</span>
                            <span>@(isEn ? "Order Sample Box (5 JOD)" : "طلب عينة حجر للموقع (5 د.أ)")</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

            <!-- 2. QUANTITY METRICS GRID (6 CLEAN FORMAL CARDS) -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
                
                <!-- Steel Rebar Card -->
                <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">@(isEn ? "Steel Rebar" : "حديد التسليح")</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-500 bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">Grade 60</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-mono" id="metricSteelQty">
                        @Model.SteelQuantityTons.ToString("N1") <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500">@(isEn ? "Tons" : "طن")</span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mt-1 pt-1 border-t border-slate-100 font-mono" id="metricSteelCost">
                        @Model.SteelCostJod.ToString("N0") @(isEn ? "JOD" : "د.أ")
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Ready-Mix Concrete Card -->
                <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">@(isEn ? "Ready-Mix Concrete" : "خرسانة جاهزة")</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-500 bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">@(isEn ? "With Pump" : "مع المضخة")</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-mono" id="metricConcreteQty">
                        @Model.ConcreteCubicMeters.ToString("N1") <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500">@(isEn ? "m³" : "م³")</span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mt-1 pt-1 border-t border-slate-100 font-mono" id="metricConcreteCost">
                        @Model.ConcreteCostJod.ToString("N0") @(isEn ? "JOD" : "د.أ")
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Cement Bags Card -->
                <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">@(isEn ? "Portland Cement" : "إسمنت مكيس")</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-500 bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">@(isEn ? "50 kg" : "50 كغم")</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-mono" id="metricCementQty">
                        @Model.CementBagsCount <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500">@(isEn ? "Bags" : "كيس")</span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mt-1 pt-1 border-t border-slate-100 font-mono" id="metricCementCost">
                        @Model.CementCostJod.ToString("N0") @(isEn ? "JOD" : "د.أ")
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Masonry Blocks Card -->
                <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">@(isEn ? "Masonry Blocks" : "طوب إسمنتي")</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-500 bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">@(isEn ? "Hollow & Ribbed" : "مفرغ وهوردي")</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-mono" id="metricBlocksQty">
                        @Model.MasonryBlocksCount <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500">@(isEn ? "Pcs" : "حبة")</span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mt-1 pt-1 border-t border-slate-100 font-mono" id="metricBlocksCost">
                        @Model.MasonryBlocksCostJod.ToString("N0") @(isEn ? "JOD" : "د.أ")
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Sand & Aggregates Card -->
                <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">@(isEn ? "Sand & Aggregate" : "رمل وحصمة")</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-500 bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">@(isEn ? "Sweileh & Pea" : "صويلح وسمسمية")</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-mono" id="metricSandQty">
                        @Model.SandAggregatesCubicMeters.ToString("N1") <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500">@(isEn ? "m³" : "م³")</span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mt-1 pt-1 border-t border-slate-100 font-mono" id="metricSandCost">
                        @Model.SandAggregatesCostJod.ToString("N0") @(isEn ? "JOD" : "د.أ")
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Estimated Labor Card -->
                <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">@(isEn ? "Labor & Workmanship" : "أجور المصنعية والمقاول")</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-500 bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">@(isEn ? "Full Skeleton" : "عظم كامل")</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">@(isEn ? "Contracting" : "مصنعية") <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500">@(isEn ? "Complete" : "كاملة")</span></p>
                    <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mt-1 pt-1 border-t border-slate-100 font-mono" id="metricLaborCost">
                        @Model.EstimatedLaborCostJod.ToString("N0") @(isEn ? "JOD" : "د.أ")
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Stone Facades Net Area Card -->
                <div id="cardStoneArea" class="bg-amber-50/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-200/80 shadow-sm @(Model.StoneModuleEnabled ? "block" : "hidden")">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-950">@(isEn ? "Stone Facades Area" : "مسطح حجر الواجهات")</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-amber-800 bg-amber-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">@(isEn ? "+7% Waste" : "شامل 7% هالك")</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-mono" id="metricStoneArea">
                        @Model.StoneNetAreaM2.ToString("N1") <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500">@(isEn ? "m²" : "م²")</span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-900 mt-1 pt-1 border-t border-amber-200/60 font-mono" id="metricStoneCost">
                        @Model.StoneMaterialCostJod.ToString("N0") @(isEn ? "JOD" : "د.أ")
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Architectural Trim & Decor Card -->
                <div id="cardStoneDecor" class="bg-amber-50/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-200/80 shadow-sm @(Model.StoneModuleEnabled ? "block" : "hidden")">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-950">@(isEn ? "Trim & Ornaments" : "الكرانيش والبراويز")</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-amber-800 bg-amber-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">@(isEn ? "Decor" : "ديكورات")</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-mono" id="metricDecorSummary">
                        @((Model.CorniceCostJod + Model.WindowFramesCostJod + Model.EntranceColumnsCostJod).ToString("N0")) <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500">@(isEn ? "JOD" : "د.أ")</span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-800 mt-1 pt-1 border-t border-amber-200/60 text-[11px]" id="metricDecorDetail">
                        @(isEn ? $"{Model.CorniceLinearMeters:N0}m Cornice • Columns" : $"{Model.CorniceLinearMeters:N0}م طولي كرانيش وأعمدة")
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>

            <!-- 3. ITEMIZED BILL OF QUANTITIES (BOQ TABLE) -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
                <div class="px-5 py-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between bg-slate-50/70">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-700 text-base">table_chart</span>
                        <span>@(isEn ? "Itemized Bill of Quantities (BOQ)" : "جدول حصر الكميات والتسعير الفوري (BOQ)")</span>
                    </h3>
                    <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium">@(isEn ? "Delivered to site & updated" : "الأسعار واصلة الموقع ومحدثة")</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                    <table class="w-full text-start text-xs">
                        <thead>
                            <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 font-bold">
                                <th class="py-3 px-4 text-start">@(isEn ? "Structural Item" : "البند الإنشائي")</th>
                                <th class="py-3 px-4 text-center">@(isEn ? "Estimated Qty" : "الكمية التقديرية")</th>
                                <th class="py-3 px-4 text-center">@(isEn ? "Unit Rate" : "سعر الوحدة")</th>
                                <th class="py-3 px-4 text-end">@(isEn ? "Estimated Total" : "التكلفة التقديرية")</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody id="breakdownTbody" class="divide-y divide-slate-100 text-slate-800">
                            @foreach (var item in Model.MaterialItems)
                            {
                                var itemName = GetItemName(item.Category, item.ItemNameAr, item.ItemNameEn);
                                var itemUnit = GetItemUnit(item.Category);
                                var itemNote = GetItemNote(item.Category, item.Note);
                                <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/80 transition-colors">
                                    <td class="py-3 px-4">
                                        <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs">@itemName</p>
                                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">@itemNote</p>
                                    </td>
                                    <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs font-mono">
                                        @item.Quantity.ToString("N1") @itemUnit
                                    </td>
                                    <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-medium text-slate-600 font-mono">
                                        @item.UnitPriceJod.ToString("N2") @(isEn ? "JOD" : "د.أ")
                                    </td>
                                    <td class="py-3 px-4 text-end font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs font-mono">
                                        @item.TotalPriceJod.ToString("N0") @(isEn ? "JOD" : "د.أ")
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            }
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- ══════════════════════ SCREEN VIEW: COMMODITY TICKER ══════════════════════ -->
    <div id="liveTickerSection" class="mt-10 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm no-print">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4 mb-6">
            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-ping"></span>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm sm:text-base">
                        @(isEn ? "Approved Jordanian Building Materials Price Index" : "مؤشر أسعار المواد الإنشائية المعتمدة في السوق الأردني")
                    </h3>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">
                    @(isEn ? "Official delivered site prices including 16% sales tax & transportation freight" : "الأسعار المعتمدة من المصانع الأردنية واصلة أرض المشروع وشاملة ضريبة المبيعات 16% ونولون التوصيل")
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 self-start sm:self-auto">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-emerald-600">sync</span>
                    <span>@(isEn ? "Live Market Rates" : "محدث لحظياً وفق البورصة والمصانع")</span>
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            @foreach (var price in prices.Take(8))
            {
                var isUp = price.Trend == "up";
                var isDown = price.Trend == "down";
                var materialName = isEn && !string.IsNullOrEmpty(price.MaterialNameEn) ? price.MaterialNameEn : price.MaterialName;
                
                var unitFormatted = isEn 
                    ? (price.MaterialCategory switch {
                        "Steel" => "Ton",
                        "Cement" => "Ton",
                        "Concrete" => "m³",
                        "Blocks" => "Pcs",
                        _ => price.UnitOfMeasure
                    })
                    : price.UnitOfMeasure;
                var currencyFormatted = isEn ? "JOD" : "د.أ";
                var priceDisplay = isEn 
                    ? $"{price.Price:N2} {currencyFormatted}/{unitFormatted}"
                    : $"{price.Price:N2} {currencyFormatted}/{unitFormatted}";

                var specDisplay = isEn 
                    ? (price.MaterialCategory switch {
                        "Steel" => "Jordanian Code JS 29 Grade 60 (8-25mm)",
                        "Cement" => "Ordinary Portland 42.5N Bulk & 50kg Bags",
                        "Concrete" => "Pump cast for footings, columns & slabs",
                        "Blocks" => "High-strength automated blocks (10/15/20cm)",
                        _ => price.Specification
                    })
                    : price.Specification;

                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:border-slate-300 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-2">
                            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 leading-snug">
                                @materialName
                            </h4>
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono flex-shrink-0 px-2 py-0.5 rounded @(isUp ? "bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800" : (isDown ? "bg-rose-100 text-rose-800" : "bg-slate-200 text-slate-700"))">
                                @price.FormattedChange
                            </span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900 font-mono tracking-tight">
                            @priceDisplay
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-3 pt-2.5 border-t border-slate-200/70">
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 font-medium leading-normal">
                            @specDisplay
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            }
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ══════════════════════ SCREEN VIEW: FAQ ACCORDION ══════════════════════ -->
    <div id="faqSection" class="mt-10 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-6 no-print">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">
                    @(isEn ? "Frequently Asked Questions on Construction Costs in Jordan" : "الأسئلة الشائعة حول تكاليف وكميات البناء في الأردن")
                </h2>
                <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-1">
                    @(isEn ? "Engineering guidance and answers based on Jordanian Building Standards." : "إرشادات هندسية وتوضيحات حول حساب الكميات والأسعار وفق المعايير الأردنية.")
                </p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 bg-slate-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-slate-200 self-start sm:self-auto">
                @(faqs.Count()) @(isEn ? "Approved FAQs" : "أسئلة منشورة")
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2.5" id="faqAccordionContainer">
            @if (!faqs.Any())
            {
                <p class="text-center text-slate-400 text-xs py-6">@(isEn ? "No published FAQs at the moment." : "لا توجد أسئلة شائعة منشورة حالياً.")</p>
            }
            else
            {
                var faqIndex = 1;
                @foreach (var faq in faqs)
                {
                    var question = isEn && !string.IsNullOrEmpty(faq.QuestionEn) ? faq.QuestionEn : faq.QuestionAr;
                    var answer = isEn && !string.IsNullOrEmpty(faq.AnswerEn) ? faq.AnswerEn : faq.AnswerAr;
                    <div class="faq-item rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/40 overflow-hidden transition-all" id="faq-card-@faq.Id">
                        <button type="button" 
                                onclick="toggleFaq(@faq.Id)"
                                class="w-full p-4 text-start font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm flex justify-between items-center gap-3 hover:bg-slate-100/60 transition-colors">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="text-slate-400 text-xs font-semibold font-mono">@faqIndex.</span>
                                <span>@question</span>
                            </span>
                            <span id="faq-icon-@faq.Id" class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-400 text-base transition-transform duration-200 flex-shrink-0">
                                expand_more
                            </span>
                        </button>
                        <div id="faq-content-@faq.Id" class="hidden px-4 pb-4 pt-1 text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100">
                            @answer
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    faqIndex++;
                }
            }
        </div>
    </div>

</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════ DEDICATED OFFICIAL PRINT REPORT (A4) ══════════════════════ -->
<div class="print-only-report p-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-black bg-white" dir="@(isRtl ? "rtl" : "ltr")">
    
    <!-- Report Header -->
    <div class="flex justify-between items-start border-b-2 border-slate-900 pb-4 mb-5">
        <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900">BLOCKO</span>
                <span class="text-xs bg-slate-900 text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">
                    @(isEn ? "Building Materials Direct Supply Platform" : "بلوكو لتوريد مواد البناء")
                </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1">@(isEn ? "Hashemite Kingdom of Jordan • Direct Construction Supplies" : "المملكة الأردنية الهاشمية • منصة التوريد الإنشائي المباشر")</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">@(isEn ? "Website: bolcko.com • Projects & Commercial Sales" : "الموقع الإلكتروني: bolcko.com • خدمة العملاء والمبيعات")</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-end text-xs space-y-1">
            <p class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">@(isEn ? "Construction Cost & Quantity Estimate Report" : "تقرير تقدير كميات وتكاليف البناء")</p>
            <p class="text-slate-600">@(isEn ? "Reference No:" : "الرقم المرجعي:") <span class="font-mono font-bold" id="printReportRef">BLK-@DateTime.Now.ToString("yyMMdd-HHmm")</span></p>
            <p class="text-slate-600">@(isEn ? "Issue Date:" : "تاريخ الإصدار:") <span class="font-mono">@DateTime.Now.ToString("yyyy/MM/dd - HH:mm")</span></p>
            <p class="text-emerald-700 font-semibold">@(isEn ? "Status: Verified with Live Market Rates" : "حالة التقدير: معتمد وفق أسعار السوق اليوم")</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Project Specifications Summary Grid -->
    <div class="border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-3.5 mb-5 bg-slate-50 page-break-avoid">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-1.5 mb-2.5">
            @(isEn ? "1. Project Specifications & Scope:" : "1. مواصفات ومحددات المشروع:")
        </h4>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs">
            <div>
                <span class="text-slate-500 block text-[10px]">@(isEn ? "Floor Footprint Area:" : "مساحة الطابق المسطح:")</span>
                <strong class="text-slate-900 font-mono" id="printArea">250 @(isEn ? "m²" : "م²")</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="text-slate-500 block text-[10px]">@(isEn ? "Number of Floors:" : "عدد الطوابق:")</span>
                <strong class="text-slate-900" id="printFloors">2 @(isEn ? "Floors" : "طوابق")</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="text-slate-500 block text-[10px]">@(isEn ? "Total Built-up Area:" : "إجمالي مسطح البناء:")</span>
                <strong class="text-slate-900 font-mono" id="printTotalArea">@Model.TotalBuiltUpArea @(isEn ? "m²" : "م²")</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="text-slate-500 block text-[10px]">@(isEn ? "Location / Governorate:" : "المحافظة / الموقع:")</span>
                <strong class="text-slate-900" id="printCity">@(isEn ? "Amman" : "عمان")</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="text-slate-500 block text-[10px]">@(isEn ? "Usage Type:" : "نوع الاستخدام:")</span>
                <strong class="text-slate-900" id="printBuildingType">@(isEn ? "Residential / Villa" : "سكني / فيلا")</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="text-slate-500 block text-[10px]">@(isEn ? "Foundation System:" : "نوع الأساسات:")</span>
                <strong class="text-slate-900" id="printFoundationType">@(isEn ? "Isolated Footings" : "قواعد منفصلة")</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="text-slate-500 block text-[10px]">@(isEn ? "Column Rebar Detail:" : "تسليح الأعمدة:")</span>
                <strong class="text-slate-900" id="printColumnBars">6 Bars (Grade 60)</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="text-slate-500 block text-[10px]">@(isEn ? "Stone Facades Cladding:" : "حجر البناء والواجهات:")</span>
                <strong class="text-slate-900" id="printStoneStatus">@(isEn ? "Included (4 Facades)" : "مشمول (4 واجهات)")</strong>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Executive Financial Total -->
    <div class="border-2 border-slate-900 rounded-lg p-4 mb-5 flex justify-between items-center bg-slate-900 text-white page-break-avoid">
        <div>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 block">
                @(isEn ? "Total Combined Construction Cost (Skeleton + Facades & Decor):" : "التكلفة التقديرية الإجمالية للمشروع (عظم كامل + حجر وديكورات الواجهات):")
            </span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mt-1">
                <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white font-mono" id="printGrandTotalCost">@Model.GrandTotalCostJod.ToString("N0")</span>
                <span class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400">@(isEn ? "JOD" : "دينار أردني")</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1">
                <span>@(isEn ? "Skeleton:" : "العظم:") <strong class="text-white font-mono" id="printSkeletonCost">@Model.TotalSkeletonCostJod.ToString("N0") د.أ</strong></span>
                <span>•</span>
                <span>@(isEn ? "Stone & Decor:" : "الحجر والديكور:") <strong class="text-amber-300 font-mono" id="printStoneCost">@Model.TotalStoneCostJod.ToString("N0") د.أ</strong></span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-end border-s border-slate-700 ps-5">
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 block">@(isEn ? "Average Cost per m²:" : "متوسط تكلفة المتر المربع مسطح:")</span>
            <span class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-mono" id="printCostPerM2">@Model.CostPerSquareMeterJod @(isEn ? "JOD/m²" : "د.أ/م²")</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Itemized Bill of Quantities (BOQ) -->
    <div class="mb-5 page-break-avoid">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900 mb-2">
            @(isEn ? "2. Itemized Bill of Quantities (BOQ):" : "2. جدول حصر الكميات والتسعير التفصيلي (Bill of Quantities):")
        </h4>
        <table class="w-full text-xs">
            <thead>
                <tr class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-bold border border-slate-300">
                    <th class="py-2 px-3 text-start">@(isEn ? "Structural Item" : "البند الإنشائي")</th>
                    <th class="py-2 px-3 text-center">@(isEn ? "Estimated Qty" : "الكمية التقديرية")</th>
                    <th class="py-2 px-3 text-center">@(isEn ? "Unit Rate" : "سعر الوحدة")</th>
                    <th class="py-2 px-3 text-end">@(isEn ? "Total Amount" : "التكلفة الإجمالية")</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="printBreakdownTbody" class="divide-y divide-slate-200">
                @foreach (var item in Model.MaterialItems)
                {
                    var itemName = GetItemName(item.Category, item.ItemNameAr, item.ItemNameEn);
                    var itemUnit = GetItemUnit(item.Category);
                    var itemNote = GetItemNote(item.Category, item.Note);
                    <tr>
                        <td class="py-2 px-3">
                            <strong class="text-slate-900">@itemName</strong>
                            <span class="text-slate-500 block text-[10px]">@itemNote</span>
                        </td>
                        <td class="py-2 px-3 text-center font-mono font-bold">@item.Quantity.ToString("N1") @itemUnit</td>
                        <td class="py-2 px-3 text-center font-mono">@item.UnitPriceJod.ToString("N2") @(isEn ? "JOD" : "د.أ")</td>
                        <td class="py-2 px-3 text-end font-mono font-bold">@item.TotalPriceJod.ToString("N0") @(isEn ? "JOD" : "د.أ")</td>
                    </tr>
                }
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <!-- Engineering Compliance Notes & Signatures -->
    <div class="border-t border-slate-300 pt-3 text-[10px] text-slate-600 space-y-1.5 page-break-avoid">
        <p>• <strong>@(isEn ? "Engineering Note:" : "ملاحظات هندسية:")</strong> @(isEn ? "This estimate is based on standard structural engineering consumption ratios in Jordanian Building Codes. Actual final quantities may vary ±5% depending on structural design drawings prepared by the supervising engineering firm." : "هذا التقدير مبني على معادلات التصميم الإنشائي المعتمدة ومعدلات الاستهلاك في الكودات الأردنية، وقد تختلف الكميات النهائية بنسبة ±5% تبعاً للمخططات الإنشائية التفصيلية المعدة من المكتب الهندسي المشرف.")</p>
        <p>• <strong>@(isEn ? "Price Validity:" : "صلاحية الأسعار:")</strong> @(isEn ? "Prices are linked to building commodity exchanges and local factory prices at the date of this report." : "الأسعار مرتبطة ببورصات المواد الإنشائية وأسعار المصانع المحلية في تاريخ إصدار هذا التقرير.")</p>
        <p>• @(isEn ? "To request supply and lock in material prices, contact BLOCKO Sales & Project Supplies via platform or phone." : "لطلب التوريد وتثبيت الأسعار، يرجى التواصل مع قسم المبيعات والمشاريع عبر منصة BLOCKO أو عبر الهاتف.")</p>
        
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center pt-6 text-xs text-slate-700">
            <div>
                <p class="font-bold">@(isEn ? "Prepared by: Structural Estimation Department" : "إعداد: قسم الحسابات والتسعير الإنشائي")</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">@(isEn ? "BLOCKO Building Materials Direct Platform" : "منصة بلوكو لتوريد مواد البناء")</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-end">
                <p class="font-bold">@(isEn ? "Official Platform Approval" : "ختم المنصة والاعتماد")</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">BLOCKO JORDAN</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>

